# IPCodex — Infrastructure Context

## Stack

- **Backend**: Python 3.11, FastAPI, Celery, SQLAlchemy (async), pgvector
- **Frontend**: React 19, Vite, TypeScript, nginx (production)
- **DB**: PostgreSQL 16 (pgvector), Redis 7
- **Storage**: MinIO (S3-compatible)
- **LLM**: Ollama (local) or OpenAI-compatible API (Gemini)
- **Monitoring**: Loki + Promtail + Grafana

## Docker

The project is fully Dockerized. Do NOT re-explore Docker setup each time.

- `docker-compose.yml` — production stack (postgres, redis, minio, api, worker, web, ollama, loki, promtail, grafana)
- `docker-compose.dev.yml` — dev (postgres only)
- `backend/Dockerfile` — Python 3.11-slim, uvicorn
- `frontend/Dockerfile` — multi-stage: node:20-alpine build + nginx:alpine serve
- `frontend/nginx.conf` — reverse proxy /api/ to `api:8000`, SPA fallback, SSE support, TUS uploads

### Key services

| Service  | Port | Image               |
|----------|------|---------------------|
| web      | 80   | frontend (nginx)    |
| api      | 8000 | backend (uvicorn)   |
| postgres | 5432 | pgvector/pgvector:pg16 |
| redis    | 6379 | redis:7-alpine      |
| minio    | 9000/9001 | minio/minio    |
| ollama   | 11434 | ollama/ollama      |
| grafana  | 3000 | grafana/grafana     |

### Common commands

- Rebuild & restart frontend: `docker compose build web && docker compose up -d web`
- Rebuild & restart backend: `docker compose build api && docker compose up -d api worker`
- Full stack up: `docker compose up -d`
- Logs: `docker compose logs -f <service>`

### Build rules

- **NEVER** use `--no-cache` unless requirements.txt or Dockerfile changed. Cached layers save disk and time.
- Use `--no-cache` only when dependencies (requirements.txt, package.json) or Dockerfile itself changed.
- Periodically run `docker system prune -f` to clean dangling images.

## Documentation language

- All project documentation (README.md, architecture/*.md, code comments) must be written in **English only**.
- The only exception is UI localization files (`frontend/src/locales/ru.json`).
- Prompt templates in `backend/app/chat/prompts/` must use English for `<instructions>`. The `<classifier_hint>` may include example queries in both RU and EN.

## Frontend assets

- Static assets in `frontend/public/` (logos, favicon)
- Theme switching via `[data-theme="dark"]` on `<html>`
- No `src/assets/` directory — all static files in `public/`
- No path aliases in tsconfig or vite config
